secr 4.5.3 is now fully on CRAN. See the NEWS <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/secr/NEWS> file for a definitive list of changes, or here <https://www.otago.ac.nz/density/News.html> for a summary. The latest version has moved to simple features (package 'sf') for interfacing spatial data, but previous formats should still be accepted (see secr-spatialdata.pdf <https://www.otago.ac.nz/density/pdfs/secr-spatialdata.pdf> for more). The shiny app hosted at Otago University has also been updated (secrapp 1.4 <https://www.stats.otago.ac.nz/secrapp/> allows one-click loading of built-in datasets).

secrdesign 2.6.0 last month was the first update for a while, with only minor changes <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/secrdesign/NEWS>. See also the updated shiny app secrdesign 1.5 <https://www.stats.otago.ac.nz/secrdesignapp/>.

Please report any problems (ideally as GitHub issues for the shiny apps).

