Hi Mitchell

addSightings is reading the first (header) line of each unmarked file as data. Delete that line or move the comment character # outside quotes and it works.

Incidentally, it should also have worked by if you added ', skip = 1' (to be passed to read.table), but a bug in addSighting meant the argument skip was not passed to read.table for multi-session input.

Cheers
Murray

